 "name_id": "Zoom Paralaks",
 "category": "transitions",
 "description": {
  "id": "Adegan lama mengecil menjadi kartu di tengah kisi sementara kartu-kartu tetangga masuk berparalaks, kamera bergeser ke kartu adegan baru, lalu kartu itu membesar memenuhi layar dan tetangganya terlempar keluar lebih cepat.",
  "en": "The old scene shrinks into the centre card of a grid as siblings parallax in, the camera pans to the next card, then that card scales up to fill the frame while siblings fly outward faster."
 },
